{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52011","headline":"泛船河上 · 王绩","name":"泛船河上","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"初晴何以慰？薄暮理轻舟。\n白云销向尽，黄河曲复流。\n随风依北岸，逐浪向南洲。\n波澜浩淼淼，怀抱直悠悠。\n自觉生如寄，方知世若浮。\n蓬莱何处在？坐使百年秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52011.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52011","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}